return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Zinn Digital® da xosting qilingan saytlar uchun. Zinn® serveringiz allaqachon taqdim etadigan sahifa keshini boshqaradi — kontent o\'zgarganda aqlli avtomatik tozalash, Zinn® boshqaruv panelidan masofadan turib tozalash, Redis ob\'ekt keshini yoqish/o\'chirish tugmasi, xavfsiz WordPress/WooCommerce istisnolari va bir marta bosish bilan administrator sifatida kirish. Bu kesh mexanizmi emas, balki kesh boshqaruvchisidir. Boshqa joyda xostingdan foydalanyapsizmi? Buning o\'rniga Zinn® Cache Engine ni o\'rnating.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Sizga keshni tozalashga ruxsat berilmagan.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Keshni tozalash soʻraldi.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Kesh: boshqa obyekt-kesh plagin o\'rnatilgan, shuning uchun Redis obyekt keshi ushbu plagin tomonidan boshqarilmaydi.','Full-page cache (LiteSpeed)'=>'Toʻliq sahifa keshi (LiteSpeed)','Enable LSCache control'=>'LSCache boshqaruvini yoqish','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages.'=>'Keshlanadigan sahifalarda LiteSpeed cache-control va tag sarlavhalarini yuborish.','Public cache lifetime (seconds)'=>'Ommaviy kesh amal qilish muddati (soniyalarda)','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Obyekt keshi (Redis)','Enable Redis object cache'=>'Redis obyekt keshini yoqish','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in (requires the phpredis extension).'=>'Redis obyekt-kesh drop-in oʻrnatish (phpredis kengaytmasi talab qilinadi).','Redis host'=>'Redis host','Redis port'=>'Redis port','Redis database'=>'Redis maʼlumotlar bazasi','Redis key prefix'=>'Redis kalit prefiksi','Automatic purging'=>'Avtomatik tozalash','Smart auto-purge'=>'Aqlli avtomatik tozalash','Purge affected pages automatically when content changes.'=>'Kontent oʻzgarganda taʼsirlangan sahifalarni avtomatik tozalash.','Purge on updates'=>'Yangilanishlarda tozalash','Purge everything after core, plugin, or theme updates.'=>'Yadro, plagin yoki mavzu yangilanishlaridan soʻng hamma narsani tozalash.','Cache exclusions'=>'Kesh istisnolari','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied (cart, checkout, my-account, logged-in and session pages are never cached). Add extra rules below, one per line.'=>'Oqilona WordPress va WooCommerce standart sozlamalari doimo qoʻllaniladi (savat, buyurtma rasmiylashtirish, hisobim, tizimga kirgan va sessiya sahifalari hech qachon keshlanmaydi). Quyida qoʻshimcha qoidalarni har bir qatorga bittadan qoʻshing.','Exclude URL paths (prefix match)'=>'URL yoʻllarini istisno qilish (prefiks boʻyicha moslik)','Exclude query keys'=>'Soʻrov kalitlarini istisno qilish','Exclude cookie name prefixes'=>'Cookie nomi prefikslarini istisno qilish','Maintenance'=>'Texnik xizmat','Purge everything now'=>'Hozir hamma narsani tozalash','detected'=>'aniqlandi','not detected'=>'aniqlanmadi','phpredis extension missing'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi yoʻq','active'=>'faol','inactive'=>'faol emas','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed keshi:','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis obyekt keshi:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Redis PHP kengaytmasi (phpredis) bu serverda mavjud emas, shuning uchun obyekt keshini yoqib boʻlmaydi.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Boshqa object-cache drop-in moduli allaqachon o‘rnatilgan. Zinn® object cache\'ni yoqishdan oldin uni olib tashlang.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Redis ulanish konfiguratsiya faylini yozib boʻlmadi.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Birlashtirilgan obyekt-kesh drop-in oʻqib boʻlmadi.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in wp-content ichiga oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in olib tashlab boʻlmadi.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress fayl tizimiga yozib boʻlmaydi, shuning uchun obyekt-kesh drop-in boshqarib boʻlmadi.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Ushbu bir marta bosish orqali kirish havolasi endi yaroqli emas. Havolalar bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng o\'z kuchini yo\'qotadi va faqat bir marta ishlatilishi mumkin — yangisini olish uchun saytingizni Zinn® boshqaruv panelidan qayta oching.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'ta olmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq sayt yuritadiganlar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni xarid qiling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.']];